#: ../../source/guides/input-db/index.md:1
msgid "The input database"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/input-db/index.md:3
msgid ""
"A run needs to know **which companies it is looking for** and **how to "
"recognise each of them in a report**. That is the input database: a "
"directory, separate from the engine and from any formats repository, "
"pointed at with `--db-directory` / `-I`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/input-db/index.md:7
msgid ""
"Keeping it separate is the same decision as keeping formats separate. "
"Which companies matter is a question about your work, not about PDF "
"parsing, and two people using the same formats repository will disagree "
"about it — legitimately."
msgstr ""

